@startuml
title sample sequence
actor User
participant Browser
participant pumlv
participant Watcher

User -> Browser: open localhost
Browser -> pumlv: GET /api/files
pumlv --> Browser: 200 (file list)
Browser -> pumlv: GET /api/events (SSE)
pumlv -> Watcher: subscribe
Watcher --> pumlv: changed
pumlv --> Browser: event: changed
@enduml
